1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,528
Apiculture is keeping honey bees in hives.

2
00:00:03,528 --> 00:00:05,598
Five species matter in Nepal.

3
00:00:05,598 --> 00:00:18,528
Apis cerana, the mauri, nests in dark cavities, so it can be coaxed into a box; it makes up about three quarters of Nepal's hives and survives up to three and a half thousand metres.

4
00:00:18,528 --> 00:00:23,320
Apis mellifera, the European bee, came in nineteen ninety two.

5
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:29,843
The rock bee, the cliff bee and the little bee build single open combs and cannot be hived.

